      "text": "Relativistic corrections for lepton-nucleus scattering in the short-time approximation — 16 sections: Relativistic corrections for lepto; Introduction; Electron-nucleus scattering cross\n\n**Relativistic corrections for lepton-nucleus scattering in the short-time approximation**\n\n*L. Andreoli1,2,∗R. Weiss3,† G. Chambers-Wall3,‡ A. Gnech1,2,§ S. Pastore3,4,¶ M. Piarulli3,4,∗∗and S. Gandolfi5*\n\n17 pp, 16 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Relativistic corrections for lepton-nucleus sc; Introduction; Electron-nucleus scattering cross section; One-Body Electromagnetic Current; Low-momentum transfer nonrelativistic reductio; High-momentum transfer nonrelativistic reducti; Comparing low- and high-momentum transfer nonr; Short-time approximation; Relativistic Final-States Kinematics; Results; High-q expansion scheme and relativistic final; Convergence of the high-q expansion scheme; Cross Sections; Conclusions; Acknowledgments; Comparison with the Rosenbluth cross section",
